stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NextCall
    NextCall --> RejectedCall : unknown tool, bad arguments, or an operation mixed with other calls
    NextCall --> WaitForMenu : open_menu
    NextCall --> WaitForWebConfirm : full web mode, address has note words the user did not type
    NextCall --> RunTool : any other tool
    WaitForWebConfirm --> DeclinedResult : No
    WaitForWebConfirm --> RunTool : Yes
    RejectedCall --> [*] : error result
    WaitForMenu --> [*] : menu result
    DeclinedResult --> [*] : declined result
    RunTool --> [*] : tool result
